   "source": "Run it with the toolchain built from [crush-ast](https://github.com/nixpt/crush-ast)\n(see [Getting Started](https://docs.crushlang.org/getting-started.html)):\n\n```sh\ncrush run hello.crush\n```\n\n## A taste\n",
   "state": {
    "status": "done"
   },
   "meta": {},
   "outputs": []
